# API backend (`api/`)

- **Node:** `>=22.12.0` (see repo `.nvmrc`).
- All routes and Gemini logic live in `api/index.js` (~single file).
- **Model:** `MODEL` constant at top (`googleai/gemini-flash-latest`). Restart after change: `systemctl restart trivia-api` (prod).
- **Secrets:** `GOOGLE_GENAI_API_KEY` in `.env` only; use `.env.example` as template.
- **Structured output:** zod schemas + `output: { schema }` on `ai.generate()` — do not parse free-form LLM text.
- **Local:** `cd api && npm ci && node index.js` → `http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/health`.
- **CORS/origin:** production allows `https://trivia.benlamb.net`; dev uses Vite proxy (same-origin from browser).

Prompt edits: test with `curl` against `/api/questions` or `/api/results` after restart. Watch correct-answer position distribution if changing shuffle instructions in prompts.
